 "title": {
  "en": "Linear trend by the method of least squares",
  "kn": "ಕನಿಷ್ಠ ವರ್ಗಗಳ ವಿಧಾನದಿಂದ ರೇಖೀಯ ಪ್ರವೃತ್ತಿ"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "The best straight line",
    "kn": "ಅತ್ಯುತ್ತಮ ಸರಳರೇಖೆ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Many lines can be drawn through scattered points. Which one is best? The one that makes the squared misses as small as possible.",
    "kn": "ಹರಡಿದ ಬಿಂದುಗಳ ಮೂಲಕ ಅನೇಕ ರೇಖೆಗಳನ್ನು ಎಳೆಯಬಹುದು. ಯಾವುದು ಉತ್ತಮ? ತಪ್ಪುಗಳ ವರ್ಗಗಳ ಮೊತ್ತವನ್ನು ಕನಿಷ್ಠಗೊಳಿಸುವ ರೇಖೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "State the principle of least squares"
    },
    {
     "en": "Fit a linear trend y = a + bX for odd and even n"
    },
    {
     "en": "Forecast with the fitted trend"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Many lines can be drawn through scattered points. Which one is best? The one that makes the squared misses as small as possible.",
    "kn": "ಹರಡಿದ ಬಿಂದುಗಳ ಮೂಲಕ ಅನೇಕ ರೇಖೆಗಳನ್ನು ಎಳೆಯಬಹುದು. ಯಾವುದು ಉತ್ತಮ? ತಪ್ಪುಗಳ ವರ್ಗಗಳ ಮೊತ್ತವನ್ನು ಕನಿಷ್ಠಗೊಳಿಸುವ ರೇಖೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Linear trend by least squares"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The principle of least squares chooses the trend so that $\\sum (y - y_t)^2$ is minimum. For $y = a + bX$ the normal equations are $\\sum y = na + b\\sum X$ and $\\sum Xy = a\\sum X + b\\sum X^2$. Shifting the origin to the middle year makes $\\sum X = 0$, so $a = \\frac{\\sum y}{n}$ and $b = \\frac{\\sum Xy}{\\sum X^2}$. For even n, take $X = 2(t - \\text{mid})$ so X = …, −3, −1, 1, 3, …; then b is the change per half-year."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Σ(y − yₜ)² is minimum; Σ(y − yₜ) = 0"
    },
    {
     "en": "Origin at the middle year → ΣX = 0"
    },
    {
     "en": "Even n: X in half-years (±1, ±3, …)"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Least squares makes the sum of squared deviations from the trend a minimum. With the origin at the middle year, a is the mean of y and b is sigma X y over sigma X squared.",
    "kn": "ಕನಿಷ್ಠ ವರ್ಗಗಳ ತತ್ವವು ಪ್ರವೃತ್ತಿಯಿಂದ ವಿಚಲನಗಳ ವರ್ಗಗಳ ಮೊತ್ತವನ್ನು ಕನಿಷ್ಠಗೊಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಮಧ್ಯ ವರ್ಷವನ್ನು ಮೂಲವಾಗಿಸಿದರೆ a = y ಯ ಸರಾಸರಿ, b = ΣXy/ΣX²."
   },
   "formula": "a = \\frac{\\sum y}{n}, \\qquad b = \\frac{\\sum Xy}{\\sum X^2}"
  },
